# The image build only needs the source tree and third_party/ (the SDL tarball
# the Dockerfile COPYs). Everything below is either regenerated inside the
# container or pure debugging spill, and shipping it as build context is what
# made `docker build` send ~8 GB and stall. Keep third_party/ - do NOT ignore it.
*.core
build/
harness/results/
.git/
*.log
